{
	"version": 5,
	"id": "BOzko5N7sSTdzdfbu",
	"notes": "A Kroot Shaper: the leader of a kindred, who decides what it eats and so what it becomes. Larger and sharper than its kin, armed like them. Point math (see Xenos/Tau/Traits/T'au Traits.adq): Kroot Physiology (112) + Kroot Kindred (-10) + Kroot Shaper Lens (55) = 157 points of traits, plus skills (101 points) = 258 points. Stats: ST 13, DX 13, IQ 11, HT 12, HP 13, Will 12, Per 13, Speed 6.25, Move 8, Dodge 9. Tier: elite human (200-350).\n\nFramework.md: 'Kindred leader; decides what the kindred eats.' Genetic Absorption is a 0-point feature of the ancestry and the Shaper is its steward; Hidden Lore (Xenos) is the mechanical proxy.",
	"traits": [
		{
			"id": "TFBsCisBSRC6pXktE",
			"name": "Kroot Physiology",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The Kroot are lean, avian-looking carnivores: hunched, long-limbed, beaked and quilled. They fight for the Empire as mercenaries, live in nomadic kindreds led by Shapers, and are best known for genetic absorption: by eating what they kill they slowly take on its traits over generations. Codex: T'au Empire background, Kroot Mercenaries.\n\nDesign: Attribute Modifiers (Kroot) 105 + Sharp Beak 1 + Acute Taste & Smell 2 (4) + Born Climber 1 + Born Tracker 1 + Genetic Absorption 0 = 112 points, giving framework.md's Kroot Carnivore line before training. Not priced: Low TL (Kroot culture is primitive but Kroot use T'au and their own guns competently; the drafter is not confident enough to charge -5), Carnivore diet (no ancestry trait; handled in the Kindred trait as a habit).",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Physical",
				"Xenos",
				"T'au",
				"Kroot"
			],
			"container_type": "ancestry",
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "tV3BHaxcH4x57Y3Ab",
					"name": "Attribute Modifiers (Kroot)",
					"local_notes": "ST +2, DX +3, IQ -1, HT +1, Per +4, Will +1, Basic Move +2.\n\nDesign: Framework Kroot Carnivore line: ST 12, DX 13, IQ 9, HT 11, HP 12, Per 13, Will 10, Move 8. ST +2 (20), DX +3 (60), IQ -1 (-20), HT +1 (10), Per +4 (20, so Per 13 with IQ 9), Will +1 (5), Basic Move +2 (B17, 5/level = 10) = 105. Basic Speed (13+11)/4 = 6.0, Move 6 + 2 = 8, HP 12 = ST 12.",
					"tags": [
						"Physical",
						"Xenos",
						"T'au",
						"Kroot"
					],
					"base_points": 105,
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "st",
							"amount": 2
						},
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "dx",
							"amount": 3
						},
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "iq",
							"amount": -1
						},
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "ht",
							"amount": 1
						},
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "per",
							"amount": 4
						},
						{
